<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" version="1.1" creator="Manatee County Hobby Reference"><metadata><name>Manatee Ham Repeaters - APPROXIMATE AREAS ONLY</name><desc>NOT actual repeater sites: plotted points are city or community markers, use only for area reference. Source and status in each waypoint.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="27.3872659" lon="-82.2681466"><name>[APPROX] NI4CE · 145.430 MHz</name><cmt>AREA APPROX – Verna center, NOT repeater</cmt><desc>callsign: NI4CE; frequency_mhz: 145.430; offset: -0.600; tone: 100.0 Hz; mode: FM; operational_status: Listed; confirm on air; notes: NI4CE linked Big Stick Verna system; city-centre placeholder only; source_url: https://srqares.org/frequencies/</desc><type>Ham repeater</type></wpt><wpt lat="27.3872659" lon="-82.2681466"><name>[APPROX] NI4CE · 442.950 MHz</name><cmt>AREA APPROX – Verna center, NOT repeater</cmt><desc>callsign: NI4CE; frequency_mhz: 442.950; offset: +5.000; tone: 100.0 Hz; mode: FM / NXDN reported; operational_status: Listed; confirm on air; notes: NI4CE linked Verna system; city-centre placeholder only; source_url: https://srqares.org/frequencies/</desc><type>Ham repeater</type></wpt><wpt lat="27.4989" lon="-82.5748"><name>[APPROX] K4GG / MARCI · 146.820 MHz</name><cmt>AREA APPROX – Bradenton center, NOT repeater</cmt><desc>callsign: K4GG; frequency_mhz: 146.820; offset: -0.600; tone: 100.0 Hz; mode: FM / club Fusion system; operational_status: Club site reports repeater down; some nets listed here; verify; notes: MARC club site had different repeater/net-status updates; do not assume on-air; source_url: https://manatee-arc.org/</desc><type>Ham repeater</type></wpt><wpt lat="27.4989" lon="-82.5748"><name>[APPROX] Manatee ARES · 147.195 MHz</name><cmt>AREA APPROX – Bradenton center, NOT repeater</cmt><desc>callsign: ARES / KM4EC (other directories: KF4MBN); frequency_mhz: 147.195; offset: +0.600; tone: 103.5 Hz; mode: FM; operational_status: Listed as ARES primary; current net usage varies; notes: Countywide ARES frequency; callsign attribution differs by source; source_url: https://srqares.org/frequencies/</desc><type>Ham repeater</type></wpt><wpt lat="27.405" lon="-82.42"><name>[APPROX] Lakewood Ranch ARES · 443.875 MHz</name><cmt>AREA APPROX – Lakewood Ranch center, NOT repeater</cmt><desc>callsign: NI4MX; frequency_mhz: 443.875; offset: +5.000; tone: 100.0 Hz; mode: FM / Fusion (directory); operational_status: Listed; confirm on air; notes: MARC/SRQARES tactical frequency; source provides general area, not site GPS; source_url: https://srqares.org/frequencies/</desc><type>Ham repeater</type></wpt><wpt lat="27.4989" lon="-82.5748"><name>[APPROX] K4BRC · 146.955 MHz</name><cmt>AREA APPROX – Bradenton center, NOT repeater</cmt><desc>callsign: K4BRC; frequency_mhz: 146.955; offset: -0.600; tone: 100.0 Hz; mode: FM; operational_status: Older local list; recheck; notes: Older community listing, not independently live-tested; source_url: https://www.sparc-club.org/ham-radio-resources/local-repeater-list/</desc><type>Ham repeater</type></wpt><wpt lat="27.4989" lon="-82.5748"><name>[APPROX] 220 MHz repeater · 224.620 MHz</name><cmt>AREA APPROX – Bradenton center, NOT repeater</cmt><desc>callsign: K4CVL (directory attribution); frequency_mhz: 224.620; offset: -1.600; tone: 100.0 Hz reported; mode: FM; operational_status: Older community report; recheck; notes: Community page confirms the 224.620 220-MHz repeater; current callsign/tone not independently established; source_url: https://www.n1gy.com/information-for-hams-visiting-west-central-florida.html</desc><type>Ham repeater</type></wpt><wpt lat="27.4989" lon="-82.5748"><name>[APPROX] ARES UHF · 442.125 MHz</name><cmt>AREA APPROX – Bradenton center, NOT repeater</cmt><desc>callsign: KF4MBN (older listing); frequency_mhz: 442.125; offset: +5.000; tone: 100.0 Hz; mode: FM; operational_status: Older directory; recheck; notes: Historical ARES/RACES listing; another directory reports KM4EC; source_url: https://www.artscipub.com/repeaters/search/index.asp?state=FLORIDA</desc><type>Ham repeater</type></wpt><wpt lat="27.4989" lon="-82.5748"><name>[APPROX] ARES UHF · 443.225 MHz</name><cmt>AREA APPROX – Bradenton center, NOT repeater</cmt><desc>callsign: KF4MBN (older listing); frequency_mhz: 443.225; offset: +5.000; tone: 103.5 Hz; mode: FM; operational_status: Older directory; recheck; notes: Historical ARES/RACES listing; another directory reports KM4EC; source_url: https://www.artscipub.com/repeaters/search/index.asp?state=FLORIDA</desc><type>Ham repeater</type></wpt></gpx>